7	+// Golden-vector generator for the VHDL flat book.
8	 // Plan: .claude/plans/vhdl-flat-book.md, step 1.
9	 //
10	-// Reuses OrderBookFlat as the oracle: emits a CSV of level operations
11	-// (op, side, tick_index, shares) interleaved with expected outputs
12	-// (level totals, best bid/ask index+shares, clamp events) for
