29	+// Usage: golden_vectors <edge|random> <depth> <out.csv> [seed]
30	+//   edge   : hand-written boundary / clamp / emptying sequence
31	+//   random : seeded pseudo-random ~10k-op sequence (determinism via the seed)
32	+//
33	+// The CSV's first line is a schema+params comment the testbench asserts before
34	+// running, so a format drift fails loudly rather than mis-parsing.
